#ASSERT `the rate in` `Article 15.1.3(d) — the table for the traction battery` `for` 36  `months of use, for business:` FALSE EQUALS 0.50
#ASSERT `the rate in` `Article 15.1.3(d) — the table for the traction battery` `for` 71  `months of use, for business:` TRUE  EQUALS 0.70
#ASSERT `the rate in` `Article 15.1.3(d) — the table for the traction battery` `for` 72  `months of use, for business:` FALSE EQUALS 0.70
