#ASSERT `Article 15.1.3 — the depreciation rate, at` 200 `months of use, for business:` TRUE `, BS01:` FALSE `, on` (`an item` `windscreen or mirror glass` `costing` 6000000 `, replaced:` TRUE) EQUALS 0
